  "finding": "For a normal local workspace with intended target branch and repo remote and at least one changed file, Uncommitted changes passes uncommitted scope to the compact/header iyi component, which returns null unless scope is all. Current discardScope(view,uncommitted,false) returns uncommitted, so both Changes-row hover and Diff header expose a discard action and set a pending uncommitted discard. Context-menu discard is intentionally all-scope in both and must remain available.",
