    "shipped_history_file": "shipped-history.txt",
    "inherited_wrong_oracle": "target.test.ts line46 expects uncommitted; target-ref.md documents the caller showRevert gate, but does not document the nested iyi all-only guard. Explicitly supersede this interpretation in new evidence after a new independent frozen regression is committed; do not silently treat the changed old assertion as unchanged proof.",
